      "quote": "The domain shows **Verified** in Organization Settings\n- Team members can sign in via your IdP without a separate Mistral password"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "quote": "SSO lets users in your Organization authenticate with their existing corporate **identity provider (IdP) credentials** using SAML 2.0."
    }
  ],
